  "enable": "H5-08 = 0 selects MEMOBUS/Modbus (1 = N2, 2 = APOGEE FLN, 3 = BACnet). Set H5-01 node address (default 1FH), H5-02 speed (default 3 = 9600 bps) and H5-03 parity (default 0 = none), then cycle power. For AUTO-mode control set b1-01 = 2 and b1-02 = 2.",
  "watchdog": "H5-05 = 1 (default) enables CE detection after H5-09 (0.0-10.0 s, default 2.0 s) without data; H5-04 sets the reaction (0 ramp, 1 coast, 2 fast stop, 3 alarm only - default, 4 run at d1-04).",
  "quirks": [
